      "tree": {
        "sha": "757d83c2002ec2f96e36093fc2913269b3c9db64",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitcoin/bitcoin/git/trees/757d83c2002ec2f96e36093fc2913269b3c9db64"
      },
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree 757d83c2002ec2f96e36093fc2913269b3c9db64\nparent b33a7fcd7bd896da7175a28802bac9ca53fa238d\nauthor will <will@256k1.dev> 1782374358 +0100\ncommitter will <will@256k1.dev> 1784976460 +0100\n\nnet: reserve pending manual connections\n\nManual -connect and -addnode callers can run concurrently during\nstartup. Existing duplicate checks only see m_nodes after a successful\nconnection attempt, so both threads can open sockets to the same target.\n\nReserve the normalized manual destination while connecting and release\nit after failure or after publishing the node, so the existing\nconnected-peer checks take over.\n\nThis applies to all `MANUAL` connection attempts, regardless of network,\nbut the keying differs by net type.\n\n- IPv4: by resolved `CService` including port.\n- IPv6: by resolved `CService` including port.\n- CJDNS: by numeric CJDNS IPv6-style addresses, via `MaybeFlipIPv6toCJDNS(...)`.\n- Tor: by v3 onion addresses.\n- I2P: by b32.i2p addresses.\n- Hostnames: keyed by the original destination string, not resolved IPs, because the guard intentionally avoids doing DNS just for the reservation.\n",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEoAg2YPI1onAAzTyBzm7EmUXBfqYFAmpklE4ACgkQzm7EmUXB\nfqaoPQ//Wg/HzkYeyTp05gZFDkKhbwaTN98NBvaiaTG7Huk7CqIj2DjUpKjj3a+H\n+bsrBc1QtAxWpPW2ofYwre9Dz1qVSnw7QTj1s/+eiEQ0h2lxvLMmEzMs+6Nk5dgC\nRVK34D0NjLThPpM9pHUojOSph0hjbH/KDMCgIAjty8xsRLDJF77NeZqCbWiV0To5\nWnzSkMxg9lSXGrlkpOpnyNksPAcSffXFASCBq3IHSMAZZ+Q0FSp6D+NjhlXgX0F5\nzc8FK14QGUSSeOET9q0xSTkhVgBf2mrm14d3OgbwrXfZz3dKgW2JFpcg6gGZIQk5\nGfWi/NMrwc38FPv7/2qcRPTsvlf+Y2trRhKP0kE2o/ymrbArc2rCsPWens/fCW5M\n821nnrMsK+YkcxA+QgHGV1/nDI8LZMVcemECcklqzS/uIZeZ6M8R4vDQq5Wt2FnJ\ngkYnl3r03VCfpzQBSoa78WXl4YWoexc9mxfM4WuRPHtCDPwRgMLsKcUu7BxXfhDG\nNC4BqJyic3wAkeR7sqpRqt2Z+FN00774fNpW+be50Msc1B+/ha+Kcz7VIVmt+t0k\nr/dWJs3eHA/iYKu0f9hAoiTLYuLySmDxxC6cy4ff3UX+0ZNIxEtyiSXXC/6oHPO+\nABOvGpdbV9vwDYtHj8huwqVx23DzOUD/B2B1efTOTXmeps0gWBM=\n=+/40\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----"
